WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.070
Ryu begins the route with standing heavy punch.

2
00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:02.270
Ryu uses standing heavy kick after cancel Drive Rush.

3
00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:02.870
A second standing heavy kick continues the combo.

4
00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:03.470
Crouching heavy kick knocks the opponent down.

5
00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:04.120
Ryu advances during the sweep knockdown with two forward dashes.

6
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:05.620
Ryu catches the rising opponent with a forward throw.
